OL,3,AGovernment 'looking seriously' at
OL,4,Abanning under-16s from Vinted and eBay
OL,5,
OL,6,FVinted and eBay could be included in
OL,7,Fthe list of platforms set to be banned
OL,8,Ffor children aged under 16, the culture
OL,9,Fsecretary has said.
OL,11,FLisa Nandy said the government was
OL,12,F"looking seriously" at including the
OL,13,Fretailing websites in the social media
OL,14,Fban "to keep children safe".
OL,16,FThe UK's social media ban for under-16s
OL,17,Fis set to come into force in March next
OL,18,Fyear, with children barred from
OL,19,Faccessing platforms such as Instagram,
OL,20,FTikTok and Snapchat.
OL,23,APub: 08-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG5/19
OL,24,ANext PageBTechnologyC Nat RadioFCulture
