OL,2,W//%*// //%Q % -,*,%%** %-.*,$-.*,%,. (,
OL,3,ACan the Zelda remake capture the magic
OL,4,Aof the original?
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt received an almost perfect score
OL,7,Ffrom critics and, decades on, remains
OL,8,Fthe highest-rated game in history on
OL,9,FMetacritic, which aggregates reviews.
OL,23,APub: 08-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG8/19
