OL,3,AMaya Jama steps down as host of reality
OL,4,ATV show Love Island
OL,5,
OL,6,FJama's announcement comes hot on the
OL,7,Fheels of an appearance as a contestant
OL,8,Fon Celebrity Traitors that won her
OL,9,Fpraise and speculation in the Times
OL,10,Fthat she could "get #1m per deal"
OL,11,Fthanks to her success.
OL,23,APub: 08-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG13/19
